<title>UK: Lasmo indicated higher on Venezuela news.</title>
<headline>Lasmo indicated higher on Venezuela news.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lasmo Plc jumped in pre-market trading on Friday, following through on Thursday's late advance sparked by the company's bullish outlook for its project in Venezuela.</p>
<p>At 0713 GMT, the shares were marked up 6-1/2p, or 2.5 percent, to 265-1/2.</p>
<p>They gained 11p on Thursday immediately after the UK oil exploration concern made its statement about the potential of its Dacion oilfield in Venezuela.</p>
</text>
